cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenXPS in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenXPS: Extended Phase-Space Simulations with OpenMM"
abstract: >-
  OpenXPS runs extended phase-space simulations with OpenMM. It adds dynamical
  variables to a physical system and couples them to collective variables or to
  force parameters, as in temperature-accelerated molecular dynamics, driven
  adiabatic free-energy dynamics and unified free-energy dynamics.
authors:
  - family-names: Abreu
    given-names: Charlles
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6956-4045"
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/craabreu/openxps"
url: "https://craabreu.github.io/openxps/latest"
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - enhanced sampling
  - extended phase space
  - free energy
  - OpenMM
